# ALLIANCE. Sources: level range = foreverchanges.pro/dungeons (Classic group-finder range, not confirmed for
# Forever); givers and Forever positions = foreverchanges.pro/dungeon-quests; entrance and prerequisites = Questie.
@dungeon The Deadmines
@levels 17-26
@window 15-25
@best 18
@hub Westfall, 56.3, 47.5, 8
@entrance Westfall, 42.5, 71.7
A 168 @ Stormwind City, 65.4, 21.2 | Wilder Thistlenettle. 4 Miners' Union Cards from the undead miners in the tunnels before the dungeon portal.
A 167 @ Stormwind City, 65.4, 21.2 | Wilder Thistlenettle. The badge drops from Foreman Thistlenettle, in the tunnels before the portal.
A 2040 @ Stormwind City, 55.5, 12.5 | Shoni the Shilent. The Gnoam Sprecklesprocket drops from Sneed's Shredder.
A 214 @ Westfall, 56.7, 47.3 | Scout Riell in the Sentinel Hill tower. 10 Red Silk Bandanas from the Defias in and around the Deadmines.
A 166 @ Westfall, 56.3, 47.5 | Gryan Stoutmantle. Kill Edwin VanCleef. Only offered after the Defias Brotherhood chain (the escort of the Defias Traitor).
RUN | The entrance is in Moonbrook, in the south-west of Westfall: through the barn-like building and down the mine tunnels to the portal. Inside: Edwin VanCleef drops An Unsent Letter that starts a quest for Baros Alexston in Stormwind.
